  node 5120), but there is NO final SAFE or UNSAFE verdict. No recipe retries,
  annotation speedup, full-model safety proof, or invariant certificate is claimed.
  This is a functional attempt; concurrent builders prevent speed conclusions.
  Evidence: check.log, result.json and executable harness check_reference.py in
  the same directory. Result JSON retains exact argv, input/source/binary hashes
  and the nested-comment-stripped executable projection hash. This observation
  was inserted after execution, changing only comments and the full-file hash.
  Source SHA256:
    10a277e29163af1e2331167cf19811d493c63d7f890ceabdbd07f48abaf92c29
